d grow stronger by GRAFTING parts of your enemies into your own flesh.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your changing body is your most powerful weapon. Choose which grafts you take to gain the abilities, upgrades, and knowledge you’ll need to survive. But there’s a cost… </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>▓  REWRITE your identity… before something <i>else</i> does.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each graft floods your system with strange cravings, half-glimpsed memories, and cruel impulses. How will you react when these urges break through? Who will you become, and how will it affect those you care about most? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>▓  EXPLORE a deadly, decaying, and darkly-captivating MEGASTRUCTURE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Arc is ancient: expanding, twisting, breaking, and reforming itself across aeons. Unearth secrets and master forgotten technologies as you journey across its endless sprawl. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>▓  CHOOSE how this dark and unconventional RPG story unfolds.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you look for a way to save the Arc, or just a way out? Who will you help, and who gets left behind? The choices you make will shape your journey and the fates of those you meet. </p>", "short_description": "YOU ARE THE SHIP OF THESEUS. Who, or what, will you be when you escape the Arc? A story-driven survival horror RPG from the makers of the Shadowrun Trilogy.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141390/ee874d893f1e979e56c7bc612badc709b4242c48/header.jpg?t=1785555835", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141390/8ece46ef7b9a6ef2dc28d870583aebc032e6c83c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785555835", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shar